5. **Other constituents**:  
   - **Saphatic acids**: Contribute to the anti-inflammatory properties of the plant.  
   - **Essential oils**: Contain volatile compounds that contribute to the scent of the plant.  

These constituents contribute to the therapeutic effects of Althaea (Marshmallow), such as its anti-inflammatory, anti-inflammatory, and antioxidant properties.  

