Without experimental data, it is not possible to definitively determine the effect of *Ulva lacutua* ethanol extract (100 µg mL⁻¹) on protein kinase A inhibition. However, based on the known medicinal properties of *Ulva lacutua*, it is possible that the extract contains bioactive compounds that can modulate PKA activity. Further research with biochemical assays is needed to confirm the exact effect of the ethanol extract on PKA inhibition.
