   \[
   V_1 = (3a)^3 = 27a^3 = 27 \text{ units}
   \]
   Solving for \( a \):
   \[
   a^3 = 1 \implies a = 1 \text{ unit}
   \]

2. **Volume of the second cube:**
   \[
   V_2 = (1a)^3 = 1a^3 = 1 \text{ unit}
   \]

Thus, the volume of the second cube is \(\boxed{1}\) unit.
