\]
\[
B = \pi \times 10^{-5} \, \text{T}
\]
\[
B = 3.14 \times 10^{-5} \, \text{T}
\]

Thus, the magnetic field strength at the center of the coil is \(\boxed{3.14 \times 10^{-5} \, \text{T}}\).
