   The vapor pressure of water at 20°C is approximately 101.325 kPa.

2. **Gage Pressure Due to Depth**:
   The gage pressure at the inlet pipe is the pressure due to the weight of the water above it.
   \[
   P_{\text{gage}} = \rho g h
   \]
   where:
