   - Here, \( P_1 = 1.0 \, \text{bar} \), \( P_2 = 1.0 \, \text{kbar} = 1000 \, \text{bar} \), \( V = 1.0 \, \text{L} \), and \( \gamma = 1.4 \).
   - Substituting the values:
     \[
     E = \frac{(1000 - 1) \times 1}{1.4 - 1} = 2500 \, \text{bar} \cdot \text{L}
     \]
   - Convert bar·L to J:
     \[
